    "label": "Month 2 \u2014 Convert the audience we built",
    "end": "2026-08-27",
    "days_left": 20,
    "rationale": "Month 1 proved the machine PRODUCES (39 reels, 29 shorts, 128 articles, ~1,250 social posts) and that production alone does not convert: 9 FB followers, 8 lifetime engagement actions, 7 email subs flat for two weeks, 0 YouTube subs off 29 shorts. Month 2 targets are rebuilt from REAL 14-day pace, not ambition \u2014 every number below is cumulative (the counters are lifetime, not per-period). Production targets stay aggressive because they cost nothing; audience targets are cut to honest multiples of actual pace so the dashboard tells the truth instead of showing 1%. The one place we deliberately under-set is ad video views: the $7/day campaign is PAUSED, so that number cannot move until Aaron resumes it. Recalibrated 2026-07-27 (weekly strategist).",
